    Wrap `keras.layers.Conv2D`:
    >>> x = np.random.rand(1, 10, 10, 1)
    >>> conv2d = SpectralNormalization(keras.layers.Conv2D(2, 2))
    >>> y = conv2d(x)
    >>> y.shape
